id: oracle-fish
name: Oracle Fish
kind: gear
itemType: buddy
special: true
buddyKind: unique
buddyEffect: passive
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Unique. Active: the Precognition Unique Ability. Adventuring: its stories, for an hour and an
  Ingredient.
text: >
  Oracle Fish: This prophetic assistant tells you about the future.
  –Special Buddy Type: Unique
  –Buddy Effect Type: Passive
  –Effects: You gain access to the Precognition Unique Ability.
  –Adventure Effect: By spending 1 Hour and an Ingredient of Uncommon or higher rarity (see —
  Cooking), you may listen to the stories of the Oracle Fish. Your ARC will tell you a story
  that hints at future events or points towards areas that may be of interest to you and your
  allies. More information and more detail will be given the more rare the Ingredient is that
  you spend on the Oracle Fish. The ARC may have the Oracle Fish be unable to tell you anything
  at the moment, but you won’t lose any Ingredients in that case.

---

# --- What is not built ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The Precognition Unique Ability, and Ingredients and Cooking, are not in this system. Its
# stories are the ARC's.
